        "bidder_id": "BID-SUB-002",
        "question": "Is experience of a parent company acceptable if the subsidiary bidding has less than 5 years?",
        "category": "Eligibility",
        "submitted_at": "2026-08-12T09:00:00",
        "answer": "No. The experience must be of the legal entity submitting the bid. Parent company experience is not transferable unless the subsidiary is the legal successor with documented evidence.",
